{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41826","headline":"庭苇 · 李中","name":"庭苇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"品格清於竹，诗家景最幽。\n从栽向池沼，长似在汀洲。\n玩好招溪叟，栖堪待野鸥。\n影疎当夕照，花乱正深秋。\n韵细堪清耳，根牢好系舟。\n故溪高岸上，冷淡有谁游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41826.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41826","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}